  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P03_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Но затем мы обнаружили странные природные аномалии.",
      "emotion": "тихое удивление, начало открытия",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "7c8b4d9795afaba90b5d7053e5cdceff3a17402a9c4d8dca8f1532540d55c88d"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P03_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Чтобы понять, как они устроены, нам пришлось ещё глубже изучать мироздание.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "f1328ae1dcc40f83e54f077b1534f144ffae2aae264b864c967c026031ed6033"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P03_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Во время исследования одной из аномалий мы повстречали твоих знакомых — магнитных существ.",
      "emotion": "узнавание, тёплое воспоминание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5600,
      "sha256": "628ef1148d9693fa7a7b955e57591e51b178b1846003324346666d97ba5d0c72"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P03_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "А дальше, в глубинах космоса, мы обнаружили удивительный артефакт.",
      "emotion": "восхищение и таинственность",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "sha256": "64f1c90a96314e84d99ee01fe1aa22457e6e226fc1f54ffcb7fd5b1482c602df"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P03_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Он оказался центром множества аномальных зон.",
      "emotion": "вдумчивое наблюдение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "sha256": "5a2e23fa10d49688b0ad6c7a400ee835f839e3dc40664bc226ec924022be6c32"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P03_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Мы сделали изучение этого сложного артефакта целью своего существования и построили вокруг него станцию «Последние врата».",
      "emotion": "решимость, многолетний научный поиск",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 8240,
      "sha256": "b2746b1d30c11f6f361225441ca6f484ac65eacc543576e36d29c93ed49650db"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P03_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Не так давно до нас дошёл странный сигнал — эхо страшных событий, происходивших где-то далеко.",
      "emotion": "нарастание тревоги, серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 6480,
      "sha256": "69c87aece296c90c1cedb9bb732b02f70ee7fbcc02c5002d7ed4b4ce9fed1ee5"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P03_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "But then we discovered strange natural anomalies.",
      "emotion": "тихое удивление, начало открытия",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3520,
      "sha256": "8ec9a96e762935e00b1ecdefacd844411b7f7253d21a9144cb3ad1ad1f16d8ae"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P03_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "To understand how they worked, we had to study the nature of the universe even more deeply.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "c817d9568a29b0d1036f64b3760c397a0e4330846584bf19b96efc37cde4d22d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P03_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "While investigating one of these anomalies, we met your familiar magnetic beings.",
      "emotion": "узнавание, тёплое воспоминание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "d59a8560fd0ae54724dabf6d2c0878cac061d501bd40c14082a904e00d91151c"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P03_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "And farther on, in the depths of space, we discovered an astonishing artifact.",
      "emotion": "восхищение и таинственность",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "08481bcb36ccd171d9195099502f59a9cc568f48716bca87cc88c8014e68998f"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P03_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "It turned out to be the center of many anomalous zones.",
      "emotion": "вдумчивое наблюдение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "3d86788b6ba46fbd5a9ca6cc49540af513553de999327571bb41275ddc4cce65"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P03_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "We made the study of this complex artifact the purpose of our existence and built a station around it called “The Last Gates.”",
      "emotion": "решимость, многолетний научный поиск",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "36c7aea11dc119f650ce9729864e911a56bfc1cb6267040cbe668ec2cb846972"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P03_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Not long ago, a strange signal reached us — an echo of terrible events happening somewhere far away.",
      "emotion": "нарастание тревоги, серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 7120,
      "sha256": "2651982766601930931210fe0956da45a4c612094b015097814879a0fa9623ea"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P03_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Mas depois descobrimos estranhas anomalias naturais.",
      "emotion": "тихое удивление, начало открытия",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "9b6620d570233adb2f982dd60f506044d9da84d9f68c7dfb0cce913f39630d5e"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P03_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Para entender como elas funcionavam, tivemos de estudar a natureza do Universo ainda mais profundamente.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6560,
      "sha256": "32153698cb081bedd25ba7f7d9b5ab0427d3e5dcfda982700cb569869c4531df"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P03_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Ao investigar uma dessas anomalias, encontramos aqueles seres magnéticos que você já conhece.",
      "emotion": "узнавание, тёплое воспоминание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "37a0165e3578f7c9259dd4e4dec00b25677964f2625524c8f6e312a7df166797"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P03_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "E mais adiante, nas profundezas do espaço, descobrimos um artefato surpreendente.",
      "emotion": "восхищение и таинственность",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "sha256": "5fef45abd2e0c3b65a95ce18f2f2cd2b594c4318f6b9ee141d22172f6a55ac8a"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P03_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Ele se revelou o centro de muitas zonas anômalas.",
      "emotion": "вдумчивое наблюдение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "ad0c47e9f92e0da9370a826e59fc0c598a754e685225c74e2c3db5b537543b89"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P03_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Transformamos o estudo desse artefato complexo no propósito da nossa existência e construímos ao seu redor uma estação chamada “Os Últimos Portais”.",
      "emotion": "решимость, многолетний научный поиск",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 9040,
      "sha256": "8b869c1cf783208dcebfab894d6b5c0446c7ea11a79d2be140f9186bd81c01ce"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P03_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Há pouco tempo, chegou até nós um sinal estranho — o eco de acontecimentos terríveis que estavam ocorrendo em algum lugar muito distante.",
      "emotion": "нарастание тревоги, серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "8d065cda04123aee1536748dcd9cfc4c4b8053ca7f09bdab369e7ca33a25848e"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P03_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Pero entonces descubrimos extrañas anomalías naturales.",
      "emotion": "тихое удивление, начало открытия",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "6391075de6e3e63813f4867656775c6c47de12ea3f6fb56a9c664d21364499ca"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P03_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Para entender cómo funcionaban, tuvimos que estudiar la naturaleza del universo aún más a fondo.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "sha256": "3bcf54b969ce825a4e1312d5a4c774cc8a0853f173f71275edbe19096a66c0c5"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P03_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Mientras investigábamos una de esas anomalías, nos encontramos con esos seres magnéticos que tú ya conoces.",
      "emotion": "узнавание, тёплое воспоминание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "98a9f29dd95220f700fd4380581d74b8653cc021b859d98ca4a06071f903ad04"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P03_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Y más adelante, en las profundidades del espacio, descubrimos un artefacto asombroso.",
      "emotion": "восхищение и таинственность",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 6720,
      "sha256": "e753fd9f1dadbd84ff80cba8f153bdd89ab910812d30ef7e8eca14bd7f3c68c0"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P03_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Resultó ser el centro de muchas zonas anómalas.",
      "emotion": "вдумчивое наблюдение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "sha256": "0d809696b2e3ed1bc6651a27c0d7beaa625a62699a171a9b11dfa22bc7c184dd"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P03_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Convertimos el estudio de este complejo artefacto en el propósito de nuestra existencia y construimos a su alrededor una estación llamada «Las Últimas Puertas».",
      "emotion": "решимость, многолетний научный поиск",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 9760,
      "sha256": "f7d6251571fdae61570aa4ad623e4398feb1add70cda4c70104eb2ef2125b790"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P03_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "No hace mucho, llegó hasta nosotros una señal extraña: el eco de terribles acontecimientos que estaban ocurriendo en algún lugar lejano.",
      "emotion": "нарастание тревоги, серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 8720,
      "sha256": "579435229e58c8c974cd0870aedc2477685a369d91a9eb6f231cdc31f6659d15"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P03_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Mais nous avons ensuite découvert d’étranges anomalies naturelles.",
      "emotion": "тихое удивление, начало открытия",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3840,
      "sha256": "94dc4ea2b66f2be15913582cbee31261c45c4481c0c468458c98538d1d298d7c"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P03_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Pour comprendre comment elles fonctionnaient, nous avons dû étudier la nature de l’Univers encore plus profondément.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "sha256": "3a24aed69a322da370407f042b42d32d0857637840390ac30eab1aeab5148d97"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P03_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "En étudiant l’une de ces anomalies, nous avons rencontré ces êtres magnétiques que tu connais déjà.",
      "emotion": "узнавание, тёплое воспоминание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "50672a5a61fe44f2b2ef9c989cdb7feb1ab2e1b96cfb6fb0384345521221d5d6"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P03_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Et plus loin, dans les profondeurs de l’espace, nous avons découvert un artefacte étonnant.",
      "emotion": "восхищение и таинственность",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "0cde873b24a8587071826db3e2b95d970dc418618a4e79f2c1a176c40f0ea9cf"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P03_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Il s’est révélé être le centre de nombreuses zones anormales.",
      "emotion": "вдумчивое наблюдение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "a76286bfb42c489f67fc31b3af9bd60205a12100efeef8d6eb9b81f755f9e512"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P03_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nous avons fait de l’étude de cet artefact complexe le but de notre existence et construit autour de lui une station appelée « Les Dernières Portes ».",
      "emotion": "решимость, многолетний научный поиск",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 8080,
      "sha256": "4e273a797334dfed7e7d08e63ee5c7f1bb963a4aed59f519a2cd208616195e17"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P03_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Il n’y a pas si longtemps, un étrange signal nous est parvenu — l’écho de terribles événements qui se produisaient quelque part au loin.",
      "emotion": "нарастание тревоги, серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 7120,
      "sha256": "6ab22f84dc02c17519e4f934e8c0e32a4e5d61ca63daeb0820cb242032dbd73a"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P03_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Doch dann entdeckten wir seltsame natürliche Anomalien.",
      "emotion": "тихое удивление, начало открытия",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "f3324d646f9f22ef495f4741673690683dedc9cacc3d0314ad36c876c888ac54"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P03_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Um zu verstehen, wie sie funktionierten, mussten wir die Natur des Universums noch tiefer erforschen.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "6c83b9674690862e55f94796e50962c057d2ee2923861309e8e407054bffc8ff"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P03_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Bei der Untersuchung einer dieser Anomalien trafen wir auf jene magnetischen Wesen, die du schon kennst.",
      "emotion": "узнавание, тёплое воспоминание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5920,
      "sha256": "15760f61208248c431700b891bcea43f4077fb107da2e1deb3cd66296f7f0e9f"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P03_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Und noch weiter, in den Tiefen des Alls, entdeckten wir ein erstaunliches Artefakt.",
      "emotion": "восхищение и таинственность",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "d7609834f183d5315888f25c2e176df9377a9b959efda0cb3c7a265bfb1260d9"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P03_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Es erwies sich als Zentrum vieler anomaler Zonen.",
      "emotion": "вдумчивое наблюдение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "a837e27e9fdb0141e57754dae6ac0dcc5220e02e1a45f9441e2edb400c15199e"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P03_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Wir machten die Erforschung dieses komplexen Artefakts zum Ziel unserer Existenz und errichteten darum eine Station mit dem Namen „Die Letzten Tore“.",
      "emotion": "решимость, многолетний научный поиск",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 9040,
      "sha256": "14ddc472b8baf36a45da4461bbffb66a15d6be90c8307a3d9a14c9531831b51c"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P03_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P03_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Vor nicht allzu langer Zeit erreichte uns ein seltsames Signal — ein Echo schrecklicher Ereignisse, die irgendwo in weiter Ferne geschahen.",
      "emotion": "нарастание тревоги, серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "926c0626e59fa63dbeaa951996485777e190e9ac37a501c13fb4de152aef7b5d"
    }
  ],
